          "reading_mnemonic": "Now that <span style="background-color: #ff00aa; color: white; padding: 0 4px; border-radius: 3px;">every</span> window is broken, you feel pretty stupid because <span style="background-color: #555; color: white; padding: 0 4px; border-radius: 3px;">mi</span>ce (まい) are pouring in through <span style="background-color: #ff00aa; color: white; padding: 0 4px; border-radius: 3px;">each</span> one. You've made a way for mice to get into your house. That wasn't smart.",
